    <briefdescription>
<para>Generic <computeroutput><ref refid="class_sum_collector" kindref="compound">SumCollector</ref></computeroutput> that accumulates into a single <computeroutput><ref refid="unionring__elem" kindref="compound">ring_elem</ref></computeroutput> via repeated <computeroutput><ref refid="class_ring_acf98d2d1f7fd61fd52af3c0a17d9d225_1acf98d2d1f7fd61fd52af3c0a17d9d225" kindref="member">Ring::add_to</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Used as the fallback when a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_ring" kindref="compound">Ring</ref></computeroutput> does not override <computeroutput>make_SumCollector()</computeroutput> to install a faster (geobucket / heap) implementation. <computeroutput><ref refid="class_sum_collector_default_af93d829f5a2bfc99497621ec73e987e0_1af93d829f5a2bfc99497621ec73e987e0" kindref="member">getValue()</ref></computeroutput> returns the running total and resets <computeroutput><ref refid="class_sum_collector_default_a23778841f5043139f8806443621a76c8_1a23778841f5043139f8806443621a76c8" kindref="member">result</ref></computeroutput> to zero so the collector can be reused. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
